The Go integer distance transform and SRGB encoding follow the repository's
viewer-app/scripts/stable-rgb-transform.cpp and generate-stable-rgb.mjs.
The TXCI v3 encoding follows TerraWasm/scripts/terrax_color_index_v3_builder.py
and its reader contract in TerraWasm/include/terra_txci.h.

This package contains no third-party Go code or dependencies. The existing
viewer-app and TerraWasm source files are project-owned references; no license
grant is inferred from their absence of a license header.
